Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.61,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(398.4,61.2)}Little Hana, the Elephant Calf
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.61,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(300.8,570.667)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, my little canary pet, Piko was very agitated, so I checked our kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I realized that our stove had been leaking gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it could have burst anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. But thanks to our little Piko, our lives were saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, our dog Mook had once...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,caught a robber who tried to sneak into our store..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My Mook is a very reliable dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Persian cat once retrieved my mum's lost ruby ring worth {\fnCalibri}¥1,000,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Animals are so loyal and lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They love you back with interest added, if you love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I too want an pet animal to catch robber and warn me about gas leakage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to surprise all by buying an exquisite animal like a Lion or an Elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know, your mum's hate for animals, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll surely come up with something, to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger Robot from the future, Doraemon-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flattering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild Pet House!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get animals using this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a green plain over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:01:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so vast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an African Savanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels little like an Anywhere Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lion! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We are saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:03:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying now? You wanted to get a lion then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! No need Lion anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna get some other animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn the dial around, you may find the animal you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Giraffe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A Hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,An elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! An elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the dial around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A Elephant calf! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it's not abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, elephant calves are surrounded by their mother and Elephants in their group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were shot by the poachers, and got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it's mother is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This elephant calf isn't looking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be hungry, it needs milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, gimme milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to get a glass of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it doesn't like a cow's milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll die if it doesn't drink it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try feeding it the Momotaro Dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's, for-all animal food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It started drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy, Young Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tickling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Little Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still up, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be late for school if you don't fall asleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Doraemon. I wonder how's Little Hana doing and what if it went somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, the door connects automatically to wherever Little Hana is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Little Hana's scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pack of Hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's an Elephant, it's but a baby, so it's still no mach for the pack of wolves...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We are safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight let's sleep together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we must send it back to Africa first thing, tomorrow morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have some good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute Little Hana is waiting for me! I must go1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Little Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an herd of Elephants...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the mother of Little Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Heave ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Nobita-kun. We must return Little Hana to it's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan is too packed and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It might fall sick if we don't return it quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best if we let Little Hana live with its mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,in a vast, windy continent like Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, run an errand for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Return Little Hana to Africa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, there's list of things to buy and money inside this bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Hana that Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0} got...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:09:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Hana is an Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an elephant doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Little Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, take out your Bamboo 'Copter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Little Hana. \NYour mother is waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's return home!
